## Summary
- restructure the Islands Nation banner with a hero description and three desktop columns of bullet highlights
- realign the happy memories gallery so the title sits in the layout, images share consistent proportions, and the section spans the viewport
- refresh the Spanish and English strings and regenerate `patches/work.patch` so the latest home updates can be shared easily

## Testing
